==Description==

The [[Image:Silk_StarTrim_CubicNStar.svg|32px]] '''Silk StarTrim_CubicNStar''' command creates a StarTrim_CubicNStar object from a CubicNStarSurface_NStar66 object.

==Usage==

# Select a [[Image:Silk_CubicNStarSurface_NStar66.svg|16px]] [[Silk_CubicNStarSurface_NStar66|CubicNStarSurface_NStar66]]
# There are several ways to invoke the command.
#* Press the {{Button|[[Image:Silk_StarTrim_CubicNStar.svg|16px]] StarTrim_CubicNStar}} button.
#* Select the {{MenuCommand|Silk → [[Image:Silk_StarTrim_CubicNStar.svg|16px]] StarTrim_CubicNStar}} option from the menu.
# A '''StarTrim_CubicNStar''' object, is created.

== Properties ==

See also: [[Property_View|Property View]].

A  '''StarTrim_CubicNStar''' is derived from a [[Part_Feature|Part feature]], or more precise a {{Incode|Part::FeaturePython}} object, and inherits all its properties. It also has the following additional property:

